  {"id":29,"x":480,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Shrouded in a dense cloud of mist and partially covered by dry brush, several rusted caltrops lie haphazardly scattered across the hard ground.  Metal spikes form the four corners of each trap, one menacing skewer left to point upwards silently through the dark underbrush.  Ominously awaiting a victim, these malicious devices only serve to make the journey even more formidable for both man and beast."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":5,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":28,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":18,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":2,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":520,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Piles of bleached, old bones are scattered across the trail.  The inquisitive traveler might wonder if these are the bleak remains of those souls for whom there was no time for burial before a hasty retreat became necessary."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":31,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":28,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":560,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Massive slabs of freestone lining the brush-covered trail are still heavily coated with a permanent layer of slick lime-wash.  The broken vine-clad stones make for a slippery trek, demonstrating one of the many ways the old wall was designed to deter intruders."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":26,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":30,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":560,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Shrouded in a dense cloud of mist and partially covered by dry brush, several rusted caltrops lie haphazardly scattered across the hard ground.  Metal spikes form the four corners of each trap, one menacing skewer left to point upwards silently through the dark underbrush.  Ominously awaiting a victim, these malicious devices only serve to make the journey even more formidable for both man and beast."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":30,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":580,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Large blocks of crenellated stone jut up through the earth, weathered and bleached by the sun long before the demon forest encroached to block out its life-giving rays.  Random piles of crumbled mortar and rubble force travelers to weave their way carefully across the narrowed pathway."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":31,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":34,"x":520,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Whether by day or by night, the thick mist enshrouds the earth like a blanket, though not a comforting cover.  The heavy haze obscures the direction and even the intensity of noises, making a snapping twig sound like a cracking whip or muting distant thunder to a muffled groan."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"north","move":"rt north"},{"to":43,"exit":"southeast","move":"rt southeast"},{"to":41,"exit":"south","move":"rt south"}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":35,"x":430,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Dense clusters of white pine trees form patches of a dark canopy that casts deep shadows across the trail.  Rotting beams of severely weathered timber lie scattered about, providing yet another obstacle to navigation through the encroaching demon forest."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":37,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":38,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":36,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":400,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Shrouded in a dense cloud of mist and partially covered by dry brush, several rusted caltrops lie haphazardly scattered across the hard ground.  Metal spikes form the four corners of each trap, one menacing skewer left to point upwards silently through the dark underbrush.  Ominously awaiting a victim, these malicious devices only serve to make the journey even more formidable for both man and beast."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"southeast","move":"rt southeast"},{"to":38,"exit":"south","move":"rt south"},{"to":39,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":40,"exit":"northwest","move":"rt northwest"}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":37,"x":460,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Large blocks of crenellated stone jut up through the earth, weathered and bleached by the sun long before the demon forest encroached to block out its life-giving rays.  Random piles of crumbled mortar and rubble force travelers to weave their way carefully across the narrowed pathway."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":35,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
