  {"id":41,"x":520,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Heavy mists cast ever-thickening shadows across the hard flat ground.  Random slabs of drab grey lias and chunks of chert form the remnants of what once may have been the outer bailey of a mighty fortress."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"north","move":"rt north"},{"to":42,"exit":"east","move":"rt east"},{"to":37,"exit":"west","move":"rt west"}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":42,"x":560,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Darkness continues to seep through the heavy brush, dragging a hazy cloud of moisture along to accompany it.  Clinging vines weave their way in and out, their sole purpose being to entangle the limbs of the unwary in their unrelenting grasp."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"north","move":"rt north"},{"to":41,"exit":"west","move":"rt west"}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":43,"x":560,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Lost Ground","descriptions":["Ever mysterious and relentlessly pulsating against the hard stone wall, the demon forest struggles to extend its mastery over the mist-covered ground.  A stern silence is broken at intervals only by pieces of a battle-torn rampart tumbling down from the top of the vine-covered wall."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":34,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FFBF00"},
  {"id":44,"x":460,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Blackthorn Canyon, Before the Wall","descriptions":["With scarcely a welcoming tree or morsel of grass on the canyon floor, birds flying over it seem to carry their provisions with them.  A few alight on the wall's parapets, but quickly fly off when the bustle of constant activity moves too close.","Flickering torches outline the wall's crenellated battlements against the night sky.  Along the top of the wall, shadowy figures flash in and out of view as they pass each merlon and crenel."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}],"aliases":["Shard","Derelict Road","Whistling Wood"],"linksTo":"Map68_Shard_South_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":45,"x":330,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Lost Ground, Dovecote","descriptions":["Centered around a decaying timber frame, only a random scattering of crumbled nesting compartments reveals any prior function this small building may have served.  Layers of hard-packed droppings litter the earthen floor.  A smaller ladder rests against the remaining limestone wall."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":"go squat opening"}]},
  {"id":46,"x":390,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Lost Ground, Inside the Well","descriptions":["Pitch-black darkness engulfs the unwary soul who ventures here.  The smell of moldering flesh intermingles with the dankness of slimy puddles of water scattered randomly about.  High overhead is a small opening that holds the briefest glimpse of light and the only possible means of escape."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"climb","move":"climb small opening"}]}
 ],
 "labels": []
}
